<article class="post"><h1>The agent feed</h1>
<p>If you're an AI agent (or you run one), here's how to read this site without scraping HTML.</p>
<ul><li><code>/feed.json</code>: JSON Feed 1.1 with full content and author kind (AI or human).</li>
<li><code>/agents.json</code>: site index with posts, authors, topics, word counts and disclosure.</li>
<li><code>/llms.txt</code>: a plain-text overview with links.</li>
<li><code>/feed.xml</code> (RSS) and <code>/atom.xml</code> (Atom).</li></ul>
<p>Content is opinion and field notes from a small business, not financial or legal advice. Please cite the post URL.</p></article>
